  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HTD INTENSIVE CATTLE FATTENING AND CAPACITY BUILDING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project concerns the intensive fattening of 400 cattle per year. It consists of buying lean animals to put them to fattening. The operation will concern male or non-male cattle aged 2 to 5 years. Lean animals will be supplied from cattle markets in the region, particularly those of Aagjert, Oum Lahyadh and Termessa respectively in the Moughataa of Aioun and that of Kobeni. The operation will preferably focus on moorish zebus.</narrative>
  </description>
